<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styles.css">
  <title>French Creek Carpentry About</title>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>
  <div class="main-container about-layout">
    <div class="about-img">
      <img src="/images/kaelyn_kyle.jpg" alt="Picture of owners Kaelyn and Kyle" class="page-image">
    </div>
    <div class="about-content-container">
      <div class="about-header page-intro">
        <h1>About French Creek Carpentry</h1>
        <h2>Making a House a Home</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <p>
          With years of remodel and woodworking experience working for others, Kaelyn and Kyle were ready to embark on
          their own adventure showcasing their talent and creativity. Wanting independence and flexibility to spend time 
          with and raising their family, they created French Creek Carpentry. From creating custom cabinetry for kitchens,
          laundry rooms, and bathrooms to making beautifully hand-crafted wooden furniture, Kaelyn and Kyle want to help make
          your house feel like home!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-contact">
        <p>Let us help you today!</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-hero">Start a Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>
</body>
</html>